<title>USA: Americas Growth to hold special meeting.</title>
<headline>Americas Growth to hold special meeting.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Americas Growth Fund Inc said it will call a special meeting of the board of directors this week to discuss the recent filing of a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission by JW Charles Financial Services Inc as part of its exchange offer.</p>
<p>JWCharles has offered to exchange 0.418 shares of common stock for each Americas Growth share.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
